        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Large Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Deltana, the Large Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pulls are available from 21-5/8 inches to 40 inches overall length. Made out of long-lasting stainless steel, they have a satin finish for easy maintenance. All length of these Modern Satin Stainless Steel Pulls are made out of 7/16 inch solid stainless steel and have a 1 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BPLG-specifcations.gif?v=1704354706\" width=\"600\" height=\"369\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in <a href=\"/products/small-length-stainless-steel-bar-pulls-from-3-inches-7-5-inches-c-c-deltana-bpxxxxss\"><b>Small Lengths</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/medium-length-stainless-steel-bar-pulls-from-10-inch-16-inch-c-c-deltana-bpxxxxss-md\"><b>Medium Lengths</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 7/16 Inch Diameter Modern Satin Stainless Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 7/16\" (12 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BPLG-Specifications.pdf?v=1691095328\"><b>Deltana Bar Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>BP1878SS: Overall Length 21-5/8\" - Center to Center 19\"</li>\r\n<li>BP1900SS: Overall Length 22\" - Center to Center 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>BP2138SS: Overall Length 24-5/8\" - Center to Center 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>BP2500SS: Overall Length 28-3/8\" - Center to Center 25-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>BP2650SS: Overall Length 28-3/8\" - Center to Center 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BP2775SS: Overall Length 31\" - Center to Center 27-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>BP3675SS: Overall Length 40\" - Center to Center 18-3/8\" and Center to Center 18-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
